{"t":"Filled Jalapeno Peppers","s":"filled-jalapeno-peppers-abfab","k":"item","i":"assets/wiki/Filled_Jalapeno_Peppers_a04183.gif","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Filled Jalapeno Peppers</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Filled Jalapeno Peppers\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Filled_Jalapeno_Peppers_a04183.gif\" width=\"32\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"objectclass\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Classification</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Plants, Animal Products, Food and Drink<br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Food\">Food</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"pickupable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Pickupable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"weight\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Weight</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">6.50 oz</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"stackable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Stackable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Trade Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"marketable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Marketable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"value\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Value</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">2,000 - 35,000 gp</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcvalue\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Sold for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">(not bought by NPCs)</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcprice\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Bought for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">(not sold by NPCs)</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Field Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"walkable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Blocking</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Utility Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"usable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Usable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"consumable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Consumable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"regenseconds\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Regeneration</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">0 seconds<br/><small>(0% full)</small></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">8.50<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">July 1, 2009<br/>Summer Update 2009</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20090620230156&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Filled_Jalapeno_Peppers_a04183.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see  filled jalapeno peppers.<div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 6.50 oz.</div><div class=\"p-flavortext\">The creamy cheese makes a great combination with the spicy peppers.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"><span class=\"tibiatext tibiaorange\"><ul class=\"sound-list\"><li>Munch.</li></ul></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>It will boost your speed by 100 levels for one hour, but be warned: if you use a haste spell or get <a href=\"#/wiki/Slowed\">paralyzed</a> during the hour after you ate it, the boost will disappear!\n</p><p>This item is very useful by low level players. Example 263 or lower level <a href=\"#/wiki/Knight\">Knight</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Paladin\">Paladin</a> will get more speed from this item then from <a href=\"#/wiki/Haste\">Haste</a> spell. <a href=\"#/wiki/Druid\">Druid</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Sorcerer\">Sorcerer</a> at level 73 or lower will get more speed by eating this dish then from using Strong Haste spell. In some cases, depending on the item's server price, it may be even more profitable to use this dish then spending <a href=\"#/wiki/Mana%20Potion\">mana potions</a> to cast <a href=\"#/wiki/Haste\">Haste</a> or Strong Haste.\n</p><p>When using Filled Jalapeno Peppers, <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Green Sparkles Effect\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Green_Sparkles_Effect_f26b9f.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span> Green Sparkles Effect will appear on the user who will get the following message: \"<span class=\"tibiatext tibiawhite\">This hot and spicy meal makes you run really fast for one hour.</span>\"\n</p><p>To create this dish, you must speak with the <a href=\"#/wiki/Djinn\">Djinn</a> <a href=\"#/wiki/Jean%20Pierre\">Jean Pierre</a> in <a href=\"#/wiki/Ankrahmun\">Ankrahmun</a>, near the Marid Fortress, during the Hot Cuisine event.\n</p><p>The value of this objects depends on year season, more closer to august more expensive.\n</p><p><b>Necessary Ingredients:</b>\n</p>\n<ul><li>10 Jalapeño Peppers <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Jalapeño Pepper\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Jalapeno_Pepper_02db27.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span></li>\n<li>2 <a href=\"#/wiki/Cheese\">Cheese</a> <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Cheese\"><img alt=\"Cheese\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Cheese_fd71d6.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></li>\n<li>1 <a href=\"#/wiki/Troll%20Green\">Troll Green</a> <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Troll%20Green\"><img alt=\"Troll Green\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Troll_Green_aa65cc.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></li>\n<li>1 <a href=\"#/wiki/Shadow%20Herb\">Shadow Herb</a> <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Shadow%20Herb\"><img alt=\"Shadow Herb\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Shadow_Herb_4c96da.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></li>\n<li>1 <a href=\"#/wiki/Vial\">Vial</a> of <a href=\"#/wiki/Mead\">Mead</a> <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Mead\"><img alt=\"Mead\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Beer_8eddda.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></li>\n<li>2 <a href=\"#/wiki/Egg\">Eggs</a> <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Egg\"><img alt=\"Egg\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Egg_e38eb8.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></li></ul>\n<p>Only obtainable through the <a href=\"#/quest/hot-cuisine-quest\">Hot Cuisine Quest</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div class=\"history-section\" id=\"w-object-history\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-History\">History</span></h3>\n<p>This item used to be named \"<i>filled jalapeño peppers</i>\" until Update 11.47.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul class=\"creature-list-generic no-results\"><li>This item is not dropped by any creatures.</li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-trades\">\n<h3 class=\"semantic-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Trade_Details\">Trade Details</span></h3>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Buy_From\">Buy From</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC sells this item.</p></div>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Sell_To\">Sell To</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC buys this item.</p></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Cheese\">Cheese</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Egg\">Egg</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Food\">Food</a></li><li>Haste (Condition)</li><li><a href=\"#/quest/hot-cuisine-quest\">Hot Cuisine Quest</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Mead\">Mead</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Shadow%20Herb\">Shadow Herb</a></li><li>Speed</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Troll%20Green\">Troll Green</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Vial\">Vial</a></li></ul>\n</div>\n</div></div></div>","quests":["hot-cuisine-quest"],"howto":{"quests":[{"slug":"hot-cuisine-quest","quest":"Hot Cuisine Quest","step":"2-6","n":13,"title":"Prato 7: Filled Jalapeño Peppers","kind":"reward","coords":[{"x":33068,"y":32531,"z":6,"label":"Jean Pierre"}]},{"slug":"hot-cuisine-quest","quest":"Hot Cuisine Quest","step":"4-0","n":24,"title":"Efeitos dos pratos","kind":"reward","coords":[]}]}}